  id: anon-truth
  shape: 6
  kind: 2
  title: 'THE DEAD EDITOR SPEAKS: "THEY MISSED!"'
  body: '"You know my name. Last week State Security shot me in the yard and threw
    me into a lime pit because I refused to kill this story. The Commandant and our
    own publisher emptied the city treasury into foreign banks. Don''t let them slip
    out on the night train. Take the streets!"'
